# Koala performance

- Do not call `reloadAll()` on every print-canvas `updateUIView`. Diff like `DrawingCanvasView` (viewport vs geometry vs selection).
- `refreshCanvas()` only calls `markDirty()`. It does not redraw the UIKit canvas. Do not use it as a refresh, and do not call it every animation frame.
- Keep export, save, thumbnail raster, and JSON encode off the main thread when adding or moving that work.
- Do not copy `referenceImageData` into every undo snapshot without a plan to share or externalize the bytes.
